OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA largely
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with patchy light rain.
OL,7,FThe rest of the night will remain
OL,8,Fcloudy with some rain at times but
OL,9,Falso some dry spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain,
OL,12,Fbut becoming drier and brighter in the
OL,13,Fafternoon for a time. Further rain
OL,14,Fspreading north in the evening heavy
OL,15,Fat times. Very warm and humid.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,18,FChangeable with a risk of showers,
OL,19,Fsome heavy on Tuesday. Showers will
OL,20,Fbecome more scattered through
OL,21,FWednesday and Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
